    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BRANT & CO Property Consultants are delighted to present 21 Waterside Lawn, Malahide to the market.\r\n\r\nThis bright and well-proportioned two-bedroom, own-door ground-floor apartment is ideally positioned within the ever-popular Waterside development and benefits from a feature rarely found with apartment living, its own private rear garden.\r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 53 sq. m. (576 sq. ft.), the property offers well-laid-out accommodation throughout. While presented in good, clean condition, the property would benefit from some modernisation and updating, offering the incoming purchaser an excellent opportunity to upgrade and personalise the accommodation to their own taste and style.\r\n\r\nOn entering the property through its own private front door, you are welcomed into a particularly spacious open-plan living and dining room. Extending to approximately 6.40m in length, this is a bright and versatile living space with a large window to the front providing plenty of natural light.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen is positioned just off the living area and is fitted with a range of wall and floor units, worktop space, oven, hob and sink, together with space for appliances. The kitchen would benefit from some updating and provides an excellent opportunity for a new owner to create a more contemporary space.\r\n\r\nThere are two well-proportioned bedrooms positioned to the rear of the property. The larger bedroom is a generous double with fitted wardrobes, while the second bedroom also benefits from storage and has direct access through glazed double doors to the private rear garden.\r\n\r\nThe garden is fully enclosed and provides a combination of lawn and patio area. This is a particularly attractive feature of the property and offers excellent potential to create a lovely private outdoor seating and entertaining space.\r\n\r\nA family bathroom and additional storage complete the accommodation.\r\n\r\nWaterside is a mature and well-established residential development, ideally positioned between Malahide and Swords, with an excellent range of shops, schools, cafés, restaurants and leisure facilities within easy reach. Dublin Airport is also conveniently accessible, while the M1 and M50 road networks provide excellent connectivity to Dublin City Centre and beyond.\r\n\r\nWith its own-door entrance, ground-floor position and private rear garden, No. 21 offers something a little different from the traditional apartment and represents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors looking for a property they can update and put their own stamp on.\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\n\r\nLiving / Dining Room Approx. 4.03m x 6.40m\r\nA spacious and bright open-plan living and dining area with timber-effect flooring, large front window and direct access from the property's own front door.\r\n\r\nKitchen Approx. 2.42m x 2.60m\r\nFitted kitchen with a range of wall and floor storage units, worktops, oven, hob, sink and space for appliances.\r\n\r\nBedroom One Approx. 2.71m x 3.69m\r\nGenerous double bedroom with fitted wardrobe and timber-effect flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom Two Approx. 2.42m x 3.09m\r\nWell-proportioned second bedroom with storage and glazed double doors providing direct access to the private rear garden.\r\n\r\nBathroom Approx. 1.68m x 2.55m\r\nBathroom with bath, WC and wash-hand basin.\r\n\r\nPrivate Rear Garden\r\nFully enclosed private rear garden with lawn and patio area, offering excellent potential for further landscaping and outdoor seating.\r\n\r\nIdeal for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and strictly by appointment through BRANT & CO Property Consultants."
      },
